studio: drop the BT_CONN_TX_MAX default

Zephyr 4.5 removes CONFIG_BT_CONN_TX_MAX, which has had no effect since 4.2
(pending TX buffers follow CONFIG_BT_BUF_ACL_TX_COUNT), and Kconfig aborts on
the now type-less symbol.  Behaviour is unchanged.

Applies to petejohanson/zmk 5565f21.

diff --git a/app/src/studio/Kconfig b/app/src/studio/Kconfig
index 1f4da6d..3a4a972 100644
--- a/app/src/studio/Kconfig
+++ b/app/src/studio/Kconfig
@@ -81,9 +81,6 @@ config ZMK_STUDIO_TRANSPORT_BLE
     default y
 
 
-config BT_CONN_TX_MAX
-    default 64 if ZMK_STUDIO_TRANSPORT_BLE
-
 if ZMK_STUDIO_TRANSPORT_BLE
 
 config ZMK_STUDIO_TRANSPORT_BLE_PREF_LATENCY
